      "description": "There will be no clean water highlights the\nextreme effects of climate change in Eswatini.\nDroughts have ravaged the country now and\nagain in the past resulting in shortages of water\nsupply and pollution has worsened the situation\nat hand. Climate change has also caused\nfrequent heatwaves. This remains an eye\nopener and a strong motivator to society that\nemploying certain efforts towards mitigating\nthe present and future effects of climate change\n\ncan be proved to be very important.",
